# Route: guide 7 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 23 to 26, 25
# quests, 2.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Redridge Mountains): Lakeshire -> Three Corners -> Lakeshire ->
# Lakeridge Highway -> Three Corners -> Lakeshire -> Lake Everstill ->
# Lakeshire -> Alther's Mill -> Galardell Valley -> Alther's Mill -> Lakeshire
# -> Redridge Canyons -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): WANTED: Gath'Ilzogg (169;
# Gath'Ilzogg 26); WANTED: Incinerator Gar'im (95999; Incinerator Gar'im 23);
# Tharil'zun (19; Tharil'zun 24); Shadow Magic (115; Blackrock Shadowcaster
# 22-23).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): What Comes Around... (386), What Comes Around... (386),
# Songblade Search (95772), Songblade Search (95772).

